  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:16 P.M.    天气/晴\n龙门中央公园，鳞鱼丸小摊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "您点的鱼丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哦哦，这口感，弹性，真不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "不愧是百大民间美食攻略推荐的店家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "客人喜欢就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......哎，你不觉得那个店主有点可怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "就是说啊，凶神恶煞的不讲，明明在卖鱼丸，为什么桌上要放把菜刀啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "而且我看攻略上说，店主是个号称鱼丸之神的老伯伯才对啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "啊，该不会是黑社会抢了摊子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "嗯？客人，还有什么需要吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "没、没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......最近的客人真奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还不是因为你的表情太凶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "还有你干嘛穿着这身就来看摊？你就不能为董阿伯的名声考虑一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "是你喔，打工结束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "算是吧。事务所那边说上次在你这儿赊了账，多少来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "三十二块六，零头抹了吧。要尝尝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "突然干嘛，我可没带多余的零钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "就当是慰问品收下吧，毕竟你们总是照顾我生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "那，我就不客气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "唔嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "好吃是好吃，但这不是阿伯的摊子吗？借花献佛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "干嘛总是要挑我刺，我会自掏腰包的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "那就好。不过你的手艺的确有进步，要是那群家伙像你这样认真对待自己的工作该多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您好，一份鱼丸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "啊，好的，客人请稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没关系，我不赶时间。这里能远远看到江景，很难得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "香味真不错，这本美食攻略还是挺靠谱的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......久等了。这是找零。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "客人请慢走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "槐琥？你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "不，那位小姐总让人觉得有点怪怪的......萨科塔人会长角的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "安魂夜化妆吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "不太像，算了，无端揣测他人可不是什么好习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "接下来你打算干什么？回事务所？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "回去复习，过两天有考试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "在安魂节当天还要念书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "安魂节是恭送灵魂的节日，现代社会对于节日的定义基本就是消费，敬谢不敏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "重点是，我可没那么多薪水，倒不如说我更希望绩点高一点，还能拿到奖学金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "呃，好吧，倒像是你的作风......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "是那些家伙和社会脱节太久了。可不要把我看作那种人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "嗯，时间应该还有很多，下一家该去哪里呢？让我看看，唔，这附近还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！立交桥上发生什么了？是车祸吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "散步的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好像不是简单的车祸，去不去凑个热闹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闲散的龙门市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又打架喔？凑热闹算我一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们这群疯子，离我远点啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......唔，这么快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "看来要提前上工了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "疼......我，被甩出来了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幸好栏杆够结实，不然冲出立交桥铁定完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，帮我一把！把我拉出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "他们要逃了，各位！我们得立刻追上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔唔唔，可这个，安全气囊，太，挤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别乱动！我的老伙计要被压扁了！喂！可颂！扣你工资喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可我、我动不了呀，德克萨斯姐压着我的腿了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "嘁，那就只好让我一个人来——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拜松！等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "围观的人越来越多，现在放跑他们就很难抓到他们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "快拉呀，那个丰蹄小子冲过来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "尽力了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "别想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "好、好重——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "怎么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有狙击手！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，德克萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（没有命中，敌人打歪了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（不对，目标是燃料箱——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "喂，怎么回事？谁在攻击那个丰蹄小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "别说了！那只狼也冲过来了，赶紧拉我出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "等等，我闻到什么味道？是不是燃料漏了？你赶紧的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......兄弟，保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你丫——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "糟糕，平衡被——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "啧，来不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
